    },
    "rule": "a w3a entry is a DIFF against `abilityBase`: a (field, level) the map writes ALWAYS wins, and stock fills only a cell the map never wrote, bounded by the ability's real level count (`alev`, else the base row's `levels`) so no level is invented.",
    "notInherited": "`acdn` (cooldown) has the same gap — A0DZ writes none and stock ANrg says Cool1..4 = 1 — but changing a cooldown is a balance decision, not a transcription fix, so it is reported not applied."
